@startuml request_event_cancellation_simple

title POST /events/{id}/cancel-request: Solicitar Cancelamento de Evento (Simplificado)

actor User
boundary "Frontend" as FE
participant "EventRequestController" as Ctrl
participant "RequestEventCancellationUseCase" as UC
database "events\nevent_requests\nevent_change_items" as DB

User -> FE: solicita cancelamento do evento e justifica
activate FE
FE -> Ctrl: POST /events/{id}/cancel-request\n{justification, userId}
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> UC: execute(id, CancelEventRequest)
activate UC

UC -> DB: busca Event por id
activate DB
DB --> UC: Optional<Event>
deactivate DB

alt encontrado
  UC -> UC: cria EventRequest (status=PENDING, type=CANCEL)\ncria EventChangeItem (before=snapshot atual, after=null)

  UC -> DB: salva event_request e event_change_item
  activate DB
  DB --> UC: ok
  deactivate DB

  UC --> Ctrl: CreateEventRequestResponse
  Ctrl --> FE: 201 Created {CreateEventRequestResponse}
  FE --> User: exibe confirmação da solicitação
else não encontrado
  UC --> Ctrl: ResourceNotFoundException
  Ctrl --> FE: 404 Not Found
  FE --> User: exibe erro
end

deactivate UC
deactivate Ctrl
deactivate FE

@enduml
